{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19101080","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19101080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910108001:0":{"text":"海に出るのを控えろだって？海が怖いからって、いつまでも村でじっとしてるわけにはいかねえだろ！","source_cn":"少出海是什么意思？我们不能因为惧怕海，就缩在村里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2745C26CA8271202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910108002:1":{"text":"食いもんはどうする？革や海藻はどうやって調達するんだ？","source_cn":"不然食物从哪里来？新的皮革和海藻又从哪里找？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C7D329E52E8219E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910108003:1":{"text":"怖じ気づいて、俺たちの信条まで忘れたのか？カシュランの民は<style=\"highlight\">海を敬えど、決して屈しねえ</style>！","source_cn":"我看你是吓破了胆子，都忘了我们对海的态度——卡什澜人<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x832A83EFB3A65F69","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910108004:1":{"text":"波が高けりゃ、それに負けねえ船を造る。潮の満ち引きがおかしくなったなら、新しい法則を見つけて乗り越える！それこそが海への敬意ってもんだろ！","source_cn":"海浪太大，那就造更好的船战胜它。潮汐乱了，那就研究新规...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x086F3211408B8773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910108005:1":{"text":"分かった、分かったから。父さん、そんな大声で叫ばないでくれよ。","source_cn":"好了好了，老爹你喊这么大声有什么用？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC931A8A92A2CE26A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910108006:1":{"text":"言いたいことは分かるけどさ、今は潮の動きが毎日変わるんだぜ？いくら丈夫な木船でも、四方八方から大波を食らったら、ひとたまりもないだろ？","source_cn":"道理咱都懂，但现在的潮汐规律每天都不一样。再厉害的木舟...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A9E507097AF9CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910108007:1":{"text":"漁猟隊も同じことを言ってたよ。海が荒れてるから、ここ数日は勝手に船を出すなってさ。だから、船はひとまず片づけとくぞ。","source_cn":"渔猎队也是这么说的，海上不太平，最近几天都不许擅自出海...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3F6977EAF2C3B3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910108008:1":{"text":"こんの……バカ息子が！俺の船には指一本触れるんじゃねえぞ！分かったか！","source_cn":"你……你这娃子！不许动我的船！听见没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E6BB412C259BD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沃卡":{"text":"ウェイカー","source":"沃卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:海戈":{"text":"ヘルゴ","source":"海戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}